                    Distribution. Drafted by Sneider on June
                    3, cleared with L/FE and OSD/ISA, and approved by Bane.
                    Repeated to CINCPAC exclusive for POLAD and Admiral Felt and to COMUS/Japan
                    for General Burns.</p>
